<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Instruments cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal said it cut Texas Instruments Inc to outperform long-term from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said the dynamic random access memory chip (DRAM) market remains depressed with continuing weak prices and excess capacity.</p>
<p>-- said has confidence in Texas Instruments long-term prospects.</p>
<p>-- Texas Instruments lost 2-1/8 to 74-3/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
